Type: Note Notes: <p>Please review the following information should you choose to use this dataset:</p><ul>  <li>Each image consists of a text file which can be opened using Matlab or an open source 3D point cloud such as Meshlab.</li>  <li>Each text file contains a measurement along the X-axis (column 1), Y-axis (column 2), and Z-axis (column 3). These measurements are in mm. A light intensity measurement is also included (column 4). The light intensity measurement is 8bit, with 256 values.</li>  <li>Each image
is geo-referenced (strike, dip). This information is included in a text file.
</li>  <li>Photographs of the test site are provided for reference.</li>  <li>The above information can also be found in a text file within the data set.</li></ul>;
